<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Edibubble Verification</title>
</head>
<body style="margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f4f4f4; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">
  <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" bgcolor="#f4f4f4">
    <tr>
      <td align="center">
        <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" style="background-color: #ffffff; margin: 40px 0; border-radius: 8px;">
          <tr>
            <td bgcolor="#ff6f00" style="padding: 20px; color: #ffffff; font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; text-align: center;">
              Edibubble
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="padding: 30px; color: #333333;">
              <h2>Your Verification Code</h2>
              <p>Use the code below to complete your registration:</p>
              <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="margin: 20px 0;">
                <tr>
                  <td align="center" style="background-color: #f0f0f0; padding: 20px; font-size: 28px; font-weight: bold; color: #000;">
                    {{.Code}}
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>
              <p>This code expires in 15 minutes. If you didn't request this, ignore the email.</p>
              <p>- The Edibubble Team</p>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td bgcolor="#eeeeee" style="padding: 20px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #777;">
              ©2025 Edibubble
            </td>
          </tr>
        </table>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</body>
</html>
